WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
TSAAT brings recorded observations about the cyber terrain together into a context aware data set.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Explore how configuration items and ICT systems connect to mission services and business services.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
TSAAT assists cyber teams in governing the cyber posture of the Defence Cyber Terrain and reducing the threat surface area of networks and ICT systems.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Understand the cyber terrain, investigate an issue or finding, and turn insights into a report.
